# No shared-file hunks: nothing outside the task's writable scope changed.
#  - TASKS.json already registers T23 and its check
#    ("pnpm","exec","vitest","run","apps/agent-host/test/t23_claude.test.ts").
#  - registry.ts is intentionally untouched: a ProviderAdapter.claudeLocal
